## B15.2 singular-value Lyapunov gap

定义

$$
\Gamma_L(s)
=
\frac1{N_L}
\log\frac{\sigma_1(\mathcal M_L(s))}
{\sigma_2(\mathcal M_L(s))}
\ge0.
\tag{B15.3}
$$

反射对称应给出

$$
\Gamma_L(1-\bar s)=\Gamma_L(s).
\tag{B15.4}
$$

而目标禁闭性质是：对任意避开临界线的紧集 $K$，

$$
\boxed{
\liminf_{L\to\infty}
\inf_{s\in K}
\Gamma_L(s)>0.}
\tag{B15.5}
$$

这就是 completed dominated splitting。

